		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φί̆λ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of sheer
				wine, given to wine,</i> of Anacreon, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				183.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόνυσος</span>”
